# mysite/maxbot/ is FROZEN as migration source-of-truth

**Date frozen:** 2026-05-09
**Reason:** Code is being migrated to `github.com/AndreyDeveloper84/ai-bot-platform`
**Linked Linear project:** https://linear.app/drfproject/project/ai-bot-platform-phase-0-87eeee7605dd
**Migration plan:** `mysite/docs/arch/PHASE0_DESIGN.md` v2 §2

---

## Freeze Policy

This directory is a snapshot used by `ai-bot-platform/legacy_maxbot/` as the AS-IS reference for the migration. Drift between `mysite/maxbot/` and `legacy_maxbot/` defeats the purpose of the freeze.

### What is allowed

- **Critical security fixes only.** A security fix MUST be cherry-picked into `ai-bot-platform/legacy_maxbot/` in the same PR window (within 24 hours).
- **Configuration adjustments** that are pure-data (env vars, feature flags, BotUser admin actions) — these don't need cherry-pick.

### What is FORBIDDEN

- New features
- Refactoring (even small)
- New tests for existing behavior
- Dependency upgrades (besides security)
- New tools / handlers / skills
- Changes to ai_concierge.py / ai_tools.py / ai_action_service.py / ai_context.py
- Changes to handlers/* (the 9 routers)
- Changes to services/nutrition_client.py beyond critical bug-fixes

### Why

Phase 0 builds `ai-bot-platform` over **20 weeks** (see [PHASE0_DESIGN.md](../../docs/arch/PHASE0_DESIGN.md) §2.3). During those 20 weeks, `mysite/maxbot/` is the production source until Sprint 8 shadow mode + Sprint 9-10 cutover. New work in this directory creates drift that has to be re-migrated.

### Process for emergency changes

1. **Open Linear ticket** explaining why this can't wait until Phase 0 cutover.
2. **Tag tech lead** in PR for review.
3. **PR title format:** `[FROZEN-EXEMPT] <change description>`.
4. **PR body MUST include:**
   - Why this can't wait (incident link / security advisory).
   - Cherry-pick plan: which commit will land in `ai-bot-platform/legacy_maxbot/`.
   - Risk assessment.
5. **Merge requires tech lead approval** (CODEOWNERS enforces this).

### Lifting the freeze

The freeze is lifted when **Sprint 10 (week 21-22) completes** and 100% MAX traffic runs on `ai-bot-platform`. At that point `mysite/maxbot/` becomes archive-only and can be deleted in a subsequent cleanup PR.

---

**TL;DR:** No new code in `mysite/maxbot/`. Build new things in `ai-bot-platform/`. If you absolutely must change something here, cherry-pick to `legacy_maxbot/` same PR.
